es to GitHub and report the latest verified commit SHA.\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTIONS\n\nDo not start over.\n\nDo not redesign Benny or my cartoon girl.\n\nDo not destroy any working gameplay.\n\nDo not generate unrelated 3D worlds.\n\nDo not duplicate completed specialist work.\n\nDo not spend paid external-service credits without my approval.\n\nPreserve the exact approved eleven-screen Rainbow experience.\n\nMY GOAL IS TO USE THE CREDITS ON THIS NEW CLAUDE ACCOUNT TO CONTINUE EXACTLY WHERE MY OTHER CLAUDE ACCOUNT STOPPED.\n\nBegin recovering the project now, verify what actually transferred, and continue improving the existing playable Rainbow game.", "operation": "enqueue", "sessionId": "025fdfec-0536-5765-8355-e6c259e1aa5d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T21:41:19.665Z", "type": "queue-operation"}
